{"version":1,"key":"card:732","content":{"id":732,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f4f2f46-eecc-4f5a-b3dc-4bb6e20aaf02","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"srcset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<img>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素上用于响应式图片加载的属性。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0efc6b1d-ad10-4483-973e-e827276d02b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目前存在很多种设备，PC、移动端，不同设备之间的分辨率和屏幕尺寸也各不相同。如果所有场景都使用同一张图片，可能会造成带宽浪费和加载速度下降，比如在低分辨率设备上加载高清大图，或在小屏手机上下载桌面端尺寸的图片，都是不必要的浪费。因此需要一种能根据设备分辨率和屏幕大小自动选择合适图片源的机制，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"srcset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是用来解决这个问题的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e46f3258-4b51-4fac-a9da-83b69b1aeec2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的语法是："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"b27e50aa-26cc-40b7-a752-2d6be21a4f02","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d66c4d96-9ef9-4a79-8a0d-4a5d77d5e8e6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<img srcset=\"url1 描述符1, url2 描述符2, ... \" sizes=\"\" src=\"fallback url\" />","collabId":"8a352a96-f51e-4560-b970-321e7820ff6c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20753cd2-fc1a-4020-848b-091f1902648d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中描述符有两种，且在同一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"srcset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中不能混用："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"67944ea8-94a5-42cb-9297-bb7efb16b39b","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1e891eb6-736e-49f1-98bc-c57c5b1231fc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ee633cf-88b7-498f-8e6e-0367605fe383","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"按照设备像素比(DPR) 选择，适用于固定尺寸场景，单位是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"0036323c-ff4b-437a-844e-de7539d68734","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0fb0f9f5-3c77-468e-b0fd-1d22ea5fb28c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<img \n  src=\"icon.png\" \n  srcset=\"icon-2x.png 2x, icon-3x.png 3x\" \n  alt=\"图标\"\n>","collabId":"821e7b9b-e872-4f4a-9a7b-5d7b6279fce8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b921b64-17b1-4390-a596-49d8fd8d0836","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 描述符时，浏览器会根据当前设备的 DPR 自动匹配对应的图片源。大多数现代移动设备的 DPR 都在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以上（如 iPhone 14 Pro 已达到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"3x"},{"type":"formatted","text":"），所以一般至少需要提供 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"2x"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的图片"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e372485a-6631-4ce1-b472-570c44bda5ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不写描述符，就默认是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1x"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，一般情况下会放到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"src"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中作为回退"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"47d8eef9-cbe6-4cd1-9402-a0e84b5fb1e7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"029f360f-51c2-4f62-ba6a-b23f07adf282","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"按照图片宽度选择，适用于响应式布局场景，单位是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0669f5f7-2ce7-4513-965f-b7be3cd58b46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 描述符表示图片文件自身的固有宽度（intrinsic width），以像素为单位。浏览器在选择图片时，会先根据 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":658,"contentId":4961,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"b8d7fc12-2d07-4332-811d-6c8566569099","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 确定图片的预期显示宽度（CSS 像素），再乘以设备的 DPR 得到实际需要的像素数，然后在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"srcset"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 候选列表中选择最合适的图片源"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"HTML","uuid":"f8c4e64e-3611-4eef-b6ed-590be2819ddf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"03b43b8c-e471-47a0-9d4e-4ab36cd85318","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<img \n  srcset=\"\n    photo-320w.jpg   320w,\n    photo-768w.jpg   768w,\n    photo-1200w.jpg 1200w,\n    photo-1920w.jpg 1920w\n  \"\n  sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, (max-width: 1000px) 50vw, 33vw\"\n  src=\"photo-768w.jpg\"\n  alt=\"照片\"\n>","collabId":"d90860bb-5e98-4696-8f14-9feb594df4d3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c0b4c610-3619-483b-9f53-1a3d9a69715c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设当前设备的 DPR 为 2，屏幕宽度为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"375px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。根据 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sizes"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的定义，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"375px"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命中了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"max-width: 600px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么预期图片的显示宽度就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"100vw"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，也就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"375px"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（CSS 像素），乘以 DPR 得到实际需要的像素数为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"375 × 2 = 750"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在候选列表中 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"768w"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是最接近且满足需求的，因此浏览器会选择 photo-768w.jpg 这张图片源"}]}]}]}],"tags":["HTML/srcset"],"createTime":1779236592375,"updateTime":1779238862102,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1779238862102},"links":{"card:658":{"key":"card:658","type":"card","id":658}}}